  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10360-GBFF-PPG -Partnership for Ecological Advancement and Conservation of Endangered Big Cats in India (PEACE +)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GBFF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full medium size project: Partnership for Ecological Advancement and Conservation of Endangered Big Cats in India (PEACE +). As described in the project concept (PPG Request Form), this project aims to secure viable populations of Snow Leopard and Tiger in Ladakh and Uttarakhand via landscape-based conservation, local community stewardship, and innovative financing.</narrative>
  </description>
